> I love the summer bounty! The fresh vegetables and fruit[ are] so[ colorful] and[ succ]ulent[,] who[ can] resist eating[ these] vibrant[ beaut]ies? Our bodies thrive on raw plant-based foods. I think this is why our creator made fruits and vegetables[ look] so[o] enticing! Asking yourself “How can I get this more of these[ beaut]ies into my diet?” Then[ follow] me over the next few weeks because I will be preparing raw plant-based recipes. Summer is the best time to set started – you’ll beat the heat (in and out of the kitchen) and eat seasonally at the same time!
This beautiful summer salad will brighten up any meal. Great with[ pe]aches or try cherries,[ n]ectarines or plums!
